CLK,	0		/THIS ROUTINE WAITS FOR THE REQUIRED NUMBER OF CLOCK TICKS
/AND THEN RETURNS.  CALL WITH:
/10 Q=CLK(H)\REM H IS THE NUMBER OF TICKS
/A CALL TO A USER FUNCTION FORCES BASIC TO DUMP THE TERMINAL RING BUFFER
