/****************** RETURN THE TIME ******************
/THIS FUNCTION RETURNS AN 11 CHARACTER STRING WITH THE 
/CURRENT TIME. SINCE THE MAXIMUM UNDIM'ED STRING LENGTH IS 10 BE SURE TO
/DIM THE STRING. CALL WITH:
/10 Q$=TIM$(0)\REMEMBER THE ARG IS IRRELLEVENT----OR
/10 PRINT TIM$(0)\IF YOU JUST WANT TO PRINT IT OUT
TIME,
