	TAD	FHOOK
	SNA CLA		/HOOK IN PLACE?
	JMP I 	UNHOOK	/NO, DON'T MESS UP BRTS
	TAD	SHOOK
	DCA I	FSTOP2
	DCA	FHOOK	/RESET HOOK FLAG
	JMP I UNHOOK
